{"id":"30f5ae06-fbc3-4285-89b2-8fedf51612b5","slug":"narnia-the-magician-s-nephew-trailer-out-emma-mackey-daniel-craig-mery","title":"Narnia: The Magician's Nephew Trailer Out: Emma Mackey, Daniel Craig, Meryl Streep","excerpt":"Official trailer for Narnia: The Magician's Nephew — premieres Feb 12, 2027.","body":"<div class=\"key-takeaways\"><ul><li>The trailer for <b>Narnia: The Magician&#x27;s Nephew</b> dropped October 13, 2026.</li><li>New movie premiering Feb 12, 2027 on Netflix India.</li><li>Greta Gerwig directs the first screen adaptation of C. S. Lewis' <i>The Magician's Nephew</i> — the creation story of Narnia.</li><li>IMAX previews begin Feb 10, 2027; the film streams on Netflix from April 2, 2027.</li></ul></div><p>The makers of <b>Narnia: The Magician&#x27;s Nephew</b> have released the official trailer, unveiled October 13, 2026.</p><p>David McKenna stars as Digory and Beatrice Campbell as Polly, with Emma Mackey as the White Witch Jadis, Daniel Craig as Uncle Andrew, Carey Mulligan as Flora Kirke and Meryl Streep voicing Aslan.</p>\n\n<youtube>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3g28OdIj6cY</youtube>\n<p>For diaspora audiences tracking the film's US release, the trailer is the first real look at what's headed to theaters.</p><div class=\"vdc\"><div class=\"vdc-glow\"></div><div class=\"vdc-title\">Film information</div><div class=\"vdc-grid\"><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">Greta Gerwig</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Director</div></div><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">Mark Ronson, Andrew Wyatt</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Music</div></div><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">Movie</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Type</div></div><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">Feb 12, 2027</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Release</div></div></div><div class=\"vdc-cast\"><div class=\"vdc-cast-lbl\">Cast</div><div class=\"cast-strip\"><div class=\"cast-member\"><div class=\"cast-initials\">DM<